              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Maono 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nami nchiona utukufu wa Mlungu wa Iziraeli uredza kula uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa. Sautiye kala ni dza mvumo wa madzi manji, na yo tsi kala inangʼala-ngʼala kpwa nyo utukufuwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go maono nrigoona kala ni dza maono nrigokala nkagaona ariphokpwedza bomola nyo mudzi na dza maono nrigoona kanda-kanda ya muho Kebari, nami nchidzibwaga chimabumabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo utukufu wa Mwenyezi Mlungu uriphokala unainjira nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu kutsupira ryango rilolaro mlairo wa dzuwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye Roho waniunula na achinireha muhala wa ndani, na lola, utukufu wa Mwenyezi Mlungu uchiodzaza yo nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye mutu ariphokala aimire phephi nami, násikira mutu anagomba nami kula mo ndani ya nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye waniamba, “Mwanadamu, phapha ndipho phatu pha chihi changu cha chifalume na phatu pha kuikira nyayo zangu, phatu ndiphosagala kahi ya atu a Iziraeli ta kare na kare. Nao atu a Iziraeli taandaritiya najisi dzina rangu takatifu, si aho wala afalume aho kpwa kuabudu vizuka vyao na kpwa nyufu za afalume aho himo mwatu mwao mwa dzulu mwa ibada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kuika chizingiti chao phephi na chizingiti changu na mimo ya miryango yao phephi na mimo ya mryango wangu na kutengbwa ni ukuta bahi. Aho kala ananajisi dzina rangu takatifu kpwa mahendo gao ga kutsukiza. Kpwa hivyo náangamiza kpwa tsukizi zangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivi sambi, naariche kuabudu vizuka na kuusa miri ya atawala aho kure nami, nami ndasagala kahi-kahi yao ta kare na kare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi uwe mwanadamu, ambira atu a Iziraeli vyo yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu irivyo na mchorowe, ili akaweze kugbwirwa ni haya kpwa makosa gao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphogbwirwa ni haya kpwa gosi arigohenda, aonyese mchoro wa yo nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, irivyopangbwa, miryango ya kutulukira na ya kuinjirira na umbore kpwa jumula na malagizoge gosi na shariyaze zosi. Gaga gaandike mbere zao, ili akale aaminifu kulunga mchorowe wosi na kulunga malagizoge gosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ndigo malagizo ga nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu: Seemu yosi ya chirere cha mwango ichiyoizunguluka indakala takatifu sana. Elewani kukala gaga ni malagizo ga nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
