            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.35+EXO.29.36+EXO.29.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 29:35–37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ye mutu achiniamba, “Mwanadamu, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi: Higa ndigo malagizo ga vira ambavyo mundalavya sadaka za kuochwa na kumwagira-mwagira mlatso phatu pha kulavira sadaka wakati ndiphodzengbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Undaapha alavyadzi-sadaka ambao ni Alawi a chivyazi cha Sadoki, edzao phephi nami kunihumikira, ndzau ya sadaka ya kuusa dambi, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Undahala seemu ya milatso upake zo pembe ne za pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka na kpwenye pembe ne za daraja na kpwenye nyo mkanda kuzunguluka. Kpwa njira iyo pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka undaphatakasa na kuphahendera upatanisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha undahala yo ndzau ya kuusa dambi na uioche pho phatu phariphotengbwa kondze ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchicha, undalavya sadaka ya kuusa dambi, ndenje isiyo na chirema na pho phatu pha kulavira sadaka phandahendwa phatakatifu dza pharivyohendwa phatakatifu kpwa ndzau iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiphomala kuphatakasa, undalavya sadaka mwana ndzau asiye na chirema na turume risiro na chirema kula mo chaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe undaareha mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, nao alavyadzi-sadaka andaatimvira munyu na kualavya dza sadaka ya kuochwa kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa muda wa siku sabaa mundalavya ndenje ya kuusira dambi chila siku. Piya mundalavya ndzau na turume asio na chirema kula mo chaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa muda wa siku sabaa andahendera phatu pha kulavira sadaka upatanisho, kuitakasa na kuitenga kpwa ajili ya Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muda uho ndiphosira, kuandzira siku ya nane na kpwenderera, alavyadzi-sadaka andalavya sadaka zenu za kuochwa na sadaka zenu za amani dzulu ya phatu pha kulavira sadaka nami ndakukubalini. Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
